# Normalise line endings in the repository to LF regardless of the OS a
# contributor is on. Windows checkouts still get CRLF locally; this only
# controls what is stored, which keeps diffs from churning between machines.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary-ish assets git should never try to normalise.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.avif binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ico binary
